\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs18 MangaShelf - Local Manga Shelf\par
\par
This software is a personal, local-first manga library viewer.\par
\par
\b What it does\b0\par
It scans folders you point it at, builds a thumbnail library in a local database,\par
and lets you tag, filter and read your own comic files.\par
\par
\b Your files stay yours\b0\par
MangaShelf never uploads anything. Library metadata is stored locally.\par
It does not modify or delete your original comic files.\par
\par
\b Requirements\b0\par
Windows 10 or later (64-bit) and the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime.\par
WebView2 ships with Windows 11 and is already present on most Windows 10 machines.\par
\par
\b No warranty\b0\par
Provided as is, without warranty of any kind.\par
